id: travel
name: Travel and hospitality
industry: Travel & hospitality
domain: Hotels and travel: properties, rooms, rates, reservations, stays, guests and flights
scope: Hotel properties, room types and rooms, rate plans and availability, guests and loyalty, reservations and booking channels, stays and folio charges, payments, reviews; and for travel, itineraries with flight segments and travellers.
summary: Describes what a hotel or travel company sells and delivers: rooms and rates, who booked what through which channel, who stayed and what they spent, and how trips are composed of flights and stays. A starter model following OpenTravel message concepts and schema.org's lodging and reservation terms.
purpose: Shared vocabulary across property management, central reservation, channel and loyalty systems; basis for occupancy, ADR and RevPAR analytics.
read: A Hotel has Room types and Rooms. A Rate plan prices a room type by date. A Guest makes a Reservation through a Booking channel for a room type and rate plan; on arrival it becomes a Stay in a Room with Folio charges and Payments. Guests may belong to a Loyalty tier and leave Reviews. An Itinerary groups reservations and Flight segments for a Traveller.
in: Property, rooms, rates; Guests and loyalty; Reservations and channels; Stays, charges, payments; Reviews; Itineraries and flights
out: Restaurant and spa operations detail; Airline operations; Housekeeping rosters; Revenue-management algorithms
std: ota | high | Reservation, room type, rate plan, guest and itinerary follow OpenTravel Alliance concepts. | Reservation, Hotel, RoomType, RatePlan, Itinerary, Guest, FlightSegment
std: schema | high | Lodging, reservations and flights are aligned to schema.org. | schema:Hotel, schema:HotelRoom, schema:LodgingReservation, schema:Flight, schema:Review
std: time | low | Stay and travel intervals follow OWL-Time. | time:Interval
== Property | Property and rooms | What is sold.
Hotel | A lodging property. | =schema:Hotel
  - hotel code : string !
  - name : string !
  - city : string
  - country : string
  - star rating : decimal
  - total rooms : integer
RoomType | A category of room with the same features and price. | ~schema:HotelRoom
  - room type code : string !
  - name : string !
  - max occupancy : integer
  - bed type : string
  > at hotel > Hotel 1 | | has room type
Room | A physical room.
  - room number : string !
  - floor : integer
  - out of order : boolean
  > of type > RoomType 1
RatePlan | A set of prices and conditions under which rooms are sold.
  - rate code : string !
  - name : string !
  - refundable : boolean
  - includes breakfast : boolean
  > at hotel > Hotel 1
DailyRate | The price of a room type under a rate plan on a date.
  - stay date : date !
  - amount : decimal !
  - rooms available : integer
  > of rate plan > RatePlan 1
  > for room type > RoomType 1
== Guest | Guests | Who stays.
Guest | A person who books or stays.
  - guest id : string !
  - name : string !
  - email : string
  - nationality : string
  > in loyalty tier > LoyaltyTier ?
LoyaltyTier | A level of the loyalty programme.
  * Member, Silver, Gold, Platinum
== Booking | Reservations | What was booked.
Reservation | A booking of rooms for dates. | ~schema:LodgingReservation
  - confirmation number : string !
  - booked at : dateTime !
  - arrival date : date !
  - departure date : date !
  - rooms : integer !
  - adults : integer
  - children : integer
  - total amount : decimal
  - cancelled at : dateTime
  > made by > Guest 1 | | makes
  > at hotel > Hotel 1
  > for room type > RoomType 1
  > on rate plan > RatePlan 1
  > through channel > BookingChannel 1
  > has status > ReservationStatus 1
BookingChannel | The route through which a booking was made.
  * Direct website, Mobile app, Call centre, Walk-in, Online travel agency, Travel agent, Corporate
ReservationStatus | The state of a reservation.
  * Confirmed, Cancelled, No show, Checked in, Checked out
== Stay | Stays and spend | What actually happened.
Stay | The actual occupation of a room by a guest.
  - checked in at : dateTime !
  - checked out at : dateTime
  - nights : integer
  > from reservation > Reservation ?
  > in room > Room 1
  > of guest > Guest 1
FolioCharge | An amount charged to a stay.
  - charged on : date !
  - amount : decimal !
  - description : string
  > to stay > Stay 1 | | has charge
  > of type > ChargeType 1
ChargeType | The kind of charge.
  * Room, Food and beverage, Spa, Laundry, Minibar, Tax, Other
Payment | Money received for a stay or reservation.
  - paid on : date !
  - amount : decimal !
  - method : string
  > for stay > Stay ?
  > for reservation > Reservation ?
Review | A guest's rating of a stay. | ~schema:Review
  - submitted on : date !
  - rating : decimal !
  - comment : string
  - platform : string
  > of stay > Stay ?
  > about hotel > Hotel 1
  > by guest > Guest ?
== Trip | Itineraries and flights | Travel around the stay.
Traveller | A person who travels on an itinerary.
  - name : string !
  - passport number : string
Itinerary | A planned trip grouping flights and hotel reservations.
  - itinerary number : string !
  - created on : date !
  - purpose : string
  > for traveller > Traveller +
  > includes stay booking > Reservation *
  > includes flight > FlightSegment *
FlightSegment | One flight from an origin airport to a destination. | ~schema:Flight
  - flight number : string !
  - departs at : dateTime !
  - arrives at : dateTime !
  - cabin class : string
  - fare : decimal
  > from airport > Airport 1
  > to airport > Airport 1
  > operated by > Airline 1
Airport | A place where flights depart and arrive.
  - iata code : string !
  - name : string
  - city : string
Airline | A carrier operating flights.
  - iata code : string !
  - name : string !
rule: derivation | Occupancy | Occupancy is room-nights occupied divided by room-nights available. | Stay, Room
rule: derivation | ADR and RevPAR | Average daily rate is room revenue divided by room-nights sold; RevPAR is room revenue divided by room-nights available. | FolioCharge, Stay, Room
rule: constraint | Dates | A reservation's departure date is after its arrival date. | Reservation
rule: constraint | No double booking | A room cannot have two stays overlapping in time. | Stay, Room
uc: Occupancy and ADR by hotel | Revenue manager | What were occupancy, ADR and RevPAR per hotel and room type last month? | Stay, Room, RoomType, Hotel, FolioCharge, ChargeType | in room, Room.of type, RoomType.at hotel, has charge, FolioCharge.of type, FolioCharge.amount, Stay.nights
uc: Channel mix and cancellations | Distribution manager | What share of bookings and of cancellations comes from each channel? | Reservation, BookingChannel, ReservationStatus | through channel, Reservation.has status, Reservation.total amount
uc: Guest history | Front desk | Show a guest's past stays, spend and reviews, and their loyalty tier. | Guest, Stay, FolioCharge, Review, LoyaltyTier | of guest, has charge, by guest, in loyalty tier, FolioCharge.amount
